ement","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"刷手後用無菌擦手巾由指尖往手肘擦乾，再穿無菌衣、戴無菌手套。"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"}]}]}},{"id":"sterile-field","depth":2,"number":"三、","title":"無菌區操作原則","children":[],"content":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"ol","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"無菌物品只能接觸無菌物品"}]},{"type":"text","value":"；有疑慮時就當作已污染。"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"使用前確認"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"有效日期"}]},{"type":"text","value":"與包外"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"消毒指示帶已變色"}]},{"type":"text","value":"(代表經過滅菌程序)；包裝破損或潮濕就不能用。"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"打開無菌包"}]},{"type":"text","value":"：放在平坦乾燥的桌面上，"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"第一角朝遠離自己"}]},{"type":"text","value":"的方向打開，最後一角朝向自己；手"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"只能碰包布四角的外面"}]},{"type":"text","value":"。已打開而未用完的無菌包"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"不可以"}]},{"type":"text","value":"原樣包回下次再用。"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"無菌區"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"邊緣 2.5 公分(1 吋)內"}]},{"type":"text","value":"視為"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"污染區"}]},{"type":"text","value":"，無菌物品要放在邊緣